==Event Information==
Hatsune Miku gets Cat-fied... for winter!<br>
Battle Cats x Hatsune Miku Collab returns for one final event!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Join in on the fun from March 15th (11am) through March 29th, 2021 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''● Hatsune Miku Collab Capsules'''}}<br>
Virtual singers from an electric dimension have warped into the Cat Empire!
For a limited time, select the Hatsune Miku tab at the top of the Rare Capsule menu for a chance to collect powerful Uber Rare collab characters only available during this event! This newest edition of this collab includes all-new Uber Rare hero {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Snow Miku 2021'''}}, Super Rare unit {{Color|#00CCFF|'''KAITO & Cat'''}} and Rare Units {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Neko Rin'''}} & {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Neko Len!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited edition collab units include...'''}}<br>
[[Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#339966|'''Hatsune Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A cute & stylish electric pop diva! Strong vs. & Weakens Red, Floating, Angels (Area Attack)<br>
[[Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF9900|'''Kagamine Rin & Len (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Powerful and charming twin vocals. Long-Range Area attacks might Knockback/Slow Black & Metal!<br>
[[Sakura Miku (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Sakura Miku (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Diva who dances among the cherry blossoms. Area attacks Freeze Aliens and might break Barriers.<br>
[[Megurine Luka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Megurine Luka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Laid-back bilingual vocalist with a silky smooth voice.<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Floating/Black<br>
[[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Osaka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Hatsune Miku MM 2020 Osaka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A new version of Miku with a special look to celebrate her appearance in Osaka for Magical Mirai 2020!<br>
Massive Area Attack damage vs Red & Angel enemies, with a chance of Savage Blow!<br>
[[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#3366FF|'''Hatsune Miku MM 2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A new version of Miku with a special look to celebrate her appearance in Tokyo for Magical Mirai 2020!<br>
Super tough vs Red & Angel enemies! Plus, negates enemy Wave attacks, and has Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''NEW:'''}} [[Snow Miku 2021 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Snow Miku 2021 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A radiant ice sculpture come to life!<br>
Tough vs Traitless enemies! Long-Range Area attacks with a chance to Freeze!<br>
[[MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''MEIKO & Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive Long-Range Area Damage to Red<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''NEW:}} [[KAITO & Cat (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''KAITO ＆ Cat (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs. Zombies, with Area Attack!<br>
[[Luka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Luka Cat (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Alien attacks<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''NEW:'''}} [[Neko Rin (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Neko Rin (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Black enemy attacks!<br>
{{Color|#FFCC00|'''NEW:'''}} [[Neko Len (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FFCC00|'''Neko Len (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Chance to Dodge Metal enemy attacks!

<small>※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance to appear from Rare Capsule draws during this event. Standard non-Collab Rare and Super Rare units may also be received during this event.<br>
※ If the Hatsune Miku capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version.</small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Stages in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
The virtual singer worldwide tour arrives in the Cat Empire for the final dates! Take on limited special stages featuring Hatsune Miku and friends!

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Hatsune Miku"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages during this collab event and select the Hatsune Miku map to take on crossover stages!<br>
Clearing any stage in this map for a small chance to unlock {{Color|#FF00FF|'''limited collab unit'''}} [[Miku Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Cat'''}}]]!<br>
More difficult later stages in the map will give you a better chance at collecting Miku Cat! Or you can use a Treasure Radar on any map for a 100% chance to earn this exclusive unit as a drop reward!

<small>※ After collecting Miku Cat, activate her for use by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.
※ If you have collected Miku Cat from a previous event, you cannot receive the unit a second time.</small><br>
{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Collab Map: "MIKU EXPO"'''}}<br>
Hatsune Miku joins Kagamine Rin & Len for a spectacular world tour to delight virtual singer fans around the globe!<br>
Battle to the beat of beloved Miku songs like "Senbonzakura", and collect tons of bonus XP rewards!

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Blitz Stage: "MIKU CHERRY"'''}}<br>
Check out collab stages heralding the arrival of spring, featuring Hatsune Miku music including hit track "Teo"!<br>
Get awesome bonus item rewards upon stage clear!<br>
These Expert-difficulty stages are only available during this event at the times below! Don't miss out on these extra rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''6:00am～8:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～2:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00pm～10:59pm'''}}

<small>※ If collab stages do not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.</small>

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Limited Collab Stage: SNOW MIKU (NEW)'''}}<br>
Take on Hatsune Miku's newest form in new stage series SNOW MIKU, aimed at high-level Battle Cats veterans! This map features the SNOW MIKU 2021 theme song "Fondant Step" as the backing track to your battle with the virtual singer's army!<br>
Earn Cat Ticket and Rare Ticket rewards based on your timed score when you clear these stages!

<small>※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to show the list of available rewards!</small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●  THE ELECTRIC DIVA STRIKES!'''}}<br>
A gauntlet challenge appearing just for this edition of the Hatsune Miku collab with The Battle Cats!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages to challenge {{Color|#FF00FF|'''The Electric Diva Strikes!'''}}, only available during this limited edition.<br>
Can you overcome a gauntlet of tough collab enemies to clear all 20 Levels! Get more rewards with every stage you pass!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Special Catclaw Dojo Stage: "MikuMiku Music Fest"'''}}<br>
Celebrate the summer return of Hatsune Miku with a special ranking challenge event!<br>
Visit the Catclaw Dojo's special collab event {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Miku Miku Music Fest'''}} and pit your score against a world of the Battle Cats fans as you race to the top of the leaderboards!<br>
Can you defeat enough enemies within the time limit to rank in the top 1% of players?<br>
Clear the stage, get a high score and earn rewards based on your score tier at the end of this collab-only Dojo challenge!<br>
※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a play ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If the Arena of Honor does not become available during this event, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Gamatoto Event! (NEW)'''}}<br>
During this event, visit the Gamatoto Exhibitions to send your adventurers to collect glorious loot, while Snow Miku's loyal pet Rabbit Yukine tags along with the Gamatoto crew and help collect extra XP and item rewards!<br>
Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Collect limited-time mission rewards by completing Hatsune Miku stages!<br>
Once you've met the requirements, head to the Catnip Challenges and accept your prizes!

※These Special missions can only be completed until March 29th, 2021 at 10:590am, so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login daily to earn items and a Rare Ticket!'''}}<br>
Every day you visit the Cat Base during this collab event, you will be rewarded with a login stamp that provides another awesome item rewards (or even a Rare Ticket?!)<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on any of the 14 days of free gifts!

